        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Memory And Recall: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the main reasons people look for a brain-support supplement is to maintain a healthy memory. Synaptigen is formulated around ingredients commonly associated with memory and cognitive wellness, including Citicoline and Bacopa Monnieri. These ingredients are intended to provide nutritional support for normal brain communication, learning, and recall. A healthy memory is important for everyday life, from remembering conversations and appointments to learning new information and completing familiar tasks efficiently. Synaptigen should not be presented as a treatment for memory disorders, but as a supplement designed to complement a healthy lifestyle and support normal cognitive function. Individual experiences may vary.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Promotes Clearer Mental Focus:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Modern life creates plenty of distractions. Phones, emails, multitasking, long work hours, and constant information can make it harder to stay focused on one task. Synaptigen is designed to support attention and mental clarity through a combination of cognitive nutrients and botanical ingredients. L-Theanine and L-Tyrosine are particularly relevant to formulas focused on calm attention and mental performance, while other ingredients provide broader nutritional support. The goal is to help users maintain a more consistent approach to everyday mental tasks instead of relying on an aggressive energy boost. Good sleep, hydration, regular meals, and movement remain important foundations for concentration.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Brain Cell Function: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Brain cells depend on healthy cellular structures and communication systems to perform their normal functions. Ingredients such as Citicoline and Phosphatidylserine are commonly used in cognitive wellness formulas because of their relationship with brain-cell membranes and cellular signaling. Omega-3 fatty acids also provide important structural fats that are relevant to normal nervous-system health. Synaptigen combines these nutrients as part of a broader formula intended to support normal brain-cell function. This benefit is especially relevant for adults who want to make cognitive wellness part of their long-term nutritional routine rather than waiting until they notice occasional mental tiredness.</span></li><li><b>Helps Support Mental Energy: </b>Mental energy is different from simply feeling physically energetic. A person can be physically rested but still feel mentally drained after hours of concentration or stressful work. Synaptigen includes ingredients such as Rhodiola Rosea, B vitamins, magnesium, and L-Tyrosine that are commonly associated with energy metabolism, nervous-system support, or stress-related mental performance. The formula is intended to provide nutritional support for maintaining mental performance during demanding days. It is not designed to replace sleep or function as a stimulant. Instead, it can be positioned as part of a balanced routine aimed at supporting consistent cognitive wellness.</li><li><b>Supports Stress-Resilient Focus: </b>Stress can make it difficult to concentrate, remember information, or complete tasks comfortably. Synaptigen includes ingredients such as L-Theanine and Rhodiola Rosea that are commonly used in wellness formulas focused on stress balance and mental performance. L-Theanine is known for supporting a calm-alert state, while Rhodiola is traditionally used as an adaptogenic herb. This combination gives Synaptigen a more balanced positioning than a product marketed only for stimulation. The goal is to support a calmer and more focused mental routine while encouraging users to address the bigger lifestyle factors that influence stress, including sleep, exercise, nutrition, and regular breaks.</li><li><b>Supports Long-Term Cognitive Wellness: </b>Taking care of the brain is a long-term process. It involves healthy nutrition, regular physical activity, quality sleep, social engagement, mental stimulation, and management of everyday stress. Synaptigen can fit into this larger routine by supplying ingredients selected for cognitive and nervous-system support. Antioxidant compounds, essential fats, vitamins, minerals, and botanical ingredients each contribute different forms of nutritional support. Rather than presenting the supplement as a quick fix, it is more accurate and natural to describe Synaptigen as a daily addition to a broader wellness plan focused on maintaining mental clarity, healthy brain function, and cognitive resilience.</li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
